WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.486
Expanding into the U.S. market can unlock massive opportunity, but it also comes with challenges that catch many international businesses off guard.

2
00:00:07.486 --> 00:00:16.332
This roadmap is Phase 1 of the UCF Soft Landing program and it is designed to help you avoid those mistakes and move forward with confidence.

3
00:00:16.332 --> 00:00:20.075
Over the next eight modules, we'll travel through Central Florida together.

4
00:00:20.075 --> 00:00:27.221
Each destination on your dashboard covers a different piece of the puzzle, from legal setup, to taxes, to U.S. business culture.

5
00:00:27.221 --> 00:00:30.623
You can move at your own pace, in any order.

6
00:00:30.623 --> 00:00:36.067
Each section includes practical guidance, tools, and short checkpoints to help you apply what you're learning.

7
00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:40.150
Use the language toggle at anytime to switch between English and Spanish.

8
00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:44.914
One important note: this program provides general guidance, not legal, tax, or immigration advice.

9
00:00:44.914 --> 00:00:47.636
Always confirm the details with a qualified professional.

10
00:00:47.636 --> 00:00:52.059
When you're ready, head back to your dashboard and pick your first destination.

11
00:00:52.059 --> 00:00:53.080
Let's get started.
